			"id": "agent-analysis-wearable-entry-hap-navigation",
			"interpretation": "products/wearable is the wearable entry HAP of a multi-product HarmonyOS sample app. module.json5 declares entry-type WearableAbility (home intent; loads pages/SplashPage, seeds AppStorage 'pageContext'/'UI_CONTEXT') and a backup extension with backup_config; build-profile.json5 lists dev/uat/uat_mirror/icsl/prod/beta/default/ohosTest targets, obfuscation off. Contract: keep srcEntry files, $profile main_pages/router_map/backup_config, and AppStorage keys in lockstep. Flow: SplashPage animates, SplashViewModel replaces PageEnum.MAIN_PAGE; MainPage stacks HomePageComponent and SampleListView in an ArcSwiper whose crown/back handling backgrounds the ability; SampleListView renders an ArcList and sends typed events to singleton SampleListViewModel, which starts a sample ability if apiVersion fits deviceInfo.sdkApiVersion, else toasts, or opens WEARABLE_SOURCE_CODE_VIEW via SourceCodeLinkPage/QRCodeComponent; router_map names must match PageEnum. Data is mock-only: WearableSampleModel/Service wrap common's MockRequest via TriggerEnums.WEARABLE_SAMPLE_TRIGGER; oh-package.json5 pins file: deps common, devpractices, commonbusiness. Tests are hypium stubs covering none of this.",
